(797, '20260114-001-35e64', '2026-01-14', 'MARIA ALYZA JOCEL S. DOMINGO', 2514, 'Licenses, Patents and Deeds Division', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Administration Aide VI', '09514112584', 'Joceldomingo2nd@gmail.com', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'to repair the printer output color', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'Upon inspection, ink overflow was found inside the printer due to an overfilled ink tank. The printer was cleaned; however, a General Error indicator remained.\r\n\r\nFurther checking revealed an unusual sound coming from the right side of the printer near the motor. The ink spillage is assessed to have caused damage to the motor. Considering the extent of the damage and the advanced age of the device, the printer is no longer economical or feasible to repair and is therefore recommended to be declared unserviceable.', 'RO LPDD', '', 0, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-14 08:16:41'),
