(806, '20260121-001-7044f', '2026-01-21', 'ADONIS M. PRESILLAS, JR.', 2438, 'FINANCE', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'REGIONAL ADMIN. & FINANCE ASSISTANT', '09918808047', 'adonispresillas107@gmail.com', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'Printer EPSON l3110 cannot print RED COLORED document.', '59', 'Assigned RICTU staff', 101, 'Vin for your appropriate action', 'RO FD', '69701edf80a91_5a1d909e-f9f9-4e84-bcc2-24b8b36a2e12.jpg', 0, 0, '', 3, '2026-01-21 00:33:35'),
(807, '20260121-001-38e2e', '2026-01-21', 'JAYSON D. PALOQUIA', 974, 'PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT DIVISION', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Statistician II', '09502889240', 'pmd.r13@denr.gov.ph', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'REPAIR OF LAPTOP CHARGER ', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'Upon checking the laptop’s charger, it was found that a power issue had caused a temporary power loss on the motherboard. The problem has already been fixed, and the laptop is now working properly and currently in use.', 'RO PMD', '', 0, 0, '', 10, '2026-01-21 07:52:49'),
(808, '20260121-002-6d5ab', '2026-01-21', 'KIM KELLY  D. DATINGGALING', 2360, 'PLANNING AND MANAGEMENT DIVISION', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'COS', '09561367172', 'pmd.r13@denr.gov.ph', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'REFORMAT LAPTOP AND INSTALL MICROSOFT OFFICE', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'The laptop has already been reformatted, and MS Office has been Installed', 'RO PMD', '', 0, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-21 07:54:42'),
(809, '20260122-001-dcd09', '2026-01-22', 'MARIA THERESA L. GEROLAGA', 1802, 'LPDD', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Forest Technician II', '09463151249', 'mlgerolaga@gmail.com', 'Other', '', 'PRINTER REPAIR', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'Upon Checking:\r\nThe printer indicator light continuously blinking, indicating a system error and need to reset.\r\nAction Taken:\r\nPerformed printer reset procedure.\r\nContinue monitoring the printer after the reset and perform nozzle check and head cleaning as needed to ensure proper print quality and functionality.\r\n', 'RO LPDD', '', 0, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-22 00:57:10'),
(810, '20260127-001-d96e2', '2026-01-27', 'MARIA ALYZA JOCEL S. DOMINGO', 2514, 'Licenses, Patents and Deeds Division', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Administration Aide VI', '09514112584', 'Joceldomingo2nd@gmail.com', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'TO REPAIR PRINTER', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'Upon inspection, the printer was found to have no black ink and had previously been repaired for the same issue. Several troubleshooting measures were conducted, including ink flushing and ink pad cleaning; however, no black ink was produced. Eventually, the printer displayed a general error, with unusual motor sounds and no ink pad movement. Ink overflow in the ink tank was also observed. Considering the unit’s age, repeated repairs, and worn-out ink pad, the printer is no longer repairable and is recommended to be declared unserviceable.', 'RO LPDD', '', 0, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-27 01:56:14'),
(811, '20260127-001-1657d', '2026-01-27', 'KAY S. DALOGDOG', 1975, 'Legal', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Forest Ranger', '09302700989', 'denr13.legal@gmail.com', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'Ink pad service is needed', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'Upon checking the printer, it was found that its waste inkpad needed to be reset. The EPSON L360 resetter was run successfully, and the printer has now been reset and is currently being used again by the end-user.', 'RO LD', '', 360289876, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-27 02:10:07'),
(812, '20260127-001-33e10', '2026-01-27', 'CHERRY MAE G. PECJO', 1724, 'Admin/Procurement ', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Office Support Staff', '09151534318', 'denr13_procurement@yahoo.com', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'for repair Printer is not printing anymore, it showing a red light and needs to be serviced by a professional.', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'Upon checking the printer, the indicator light showed that service was required. The printer firmware was reset as part of the troubleshooting process, and the device is now functioning properly and can be used again by the user.', 'RO ASD', '', 0, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-27 03:00:17'),
(813, '20260128-001-a6f90', '2026-01-28', 'SUGAR E. PERAS', 1844, 'LPDD/WRPS', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Stat I', '09506375064', 'pmd.r13@denr.gov.ph', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'Installation of New Printer', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'The new printer was installed and properly configured with the necessary driver for operation.', 'RO PMD', '', 2147483647, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-28 01:28:35'),
(814, '20260128-001-f0827', '2026-01-28', 'JENNY MAE M. CULLANTES', 2756, 'PLANNING', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'FPO/PLANNING STAFF', '09100065698', 'enforcement_division@yahoo.com', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'Install new SDD and memory card', '102', 'Completed', 101, 'The laptop was running slowly because it was still using an HDD. To improve its performance, the HDD was replaced with an SSD, resulting in faster and smoother operation.', 'RO ED', '', 541, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-28 03:23:23'),
(815, '20260128-002-bccf3', '2026-01-28', 'JESSIE  M. CORALER', 1259, 'Enforcement Division', 'REGIONAL OFFICE', 'Forest Ranger', '09388950323', 'enforcement_division@yahoo.com', 'Technical Assistance', '', 'Install SSD', '103', 'Completed', 101, 'Upon checking the computer, the HDD was replaced with an SSD to improve performance. However, after the replacement, Windows 11 could not be installed because the system does not meet the minimum requirements, specifically the processor requirement of at least an Intel Core i5 (8th Generation).\r\n\r\nInstalling Windows 10 is also not recommended since it is no longer supported by Microsoft in terms of security updates.\r\n\r\nConsidering that the desktop was purchased in 2017 and is already outdated, it can no longer keep up with modern system requirements. In view of these limitations, it is therefore recommended that the unit be declared unserviceable.', 'RO ED', '', 10365, 0, '', 4, '2026-01-28 03:28:26'),
