(458, 722, '2025-11-20', '09:39:16 AM', 'Corrupted Memory card\r\nAction Taken:  Fix corrupted SD card using CMD methods.\r\nRecommendation:  It is recommended to purchase SD cards only from trusted or authorized stores to ensure reliability and prevent data corruption. It is also advised to back up your files regularly for safety and future use.', 'CHERRY C. GUMANIT'),
(459, 746, '2025-11-20', '10:01:32 AM', 'Upon checking the printer, a foreign object was found stuck inside, which caused the paper jam.\r\nAction Taken:  The Object carefully removed inside the printer and Perform the regular maintenance checks to prevent jams.\r\nRecommendation:  Cover the printer after use to protect it from dust and foreign objects and perform regular maintenance and inspection to ensure smooth printer operation.\r\n', 'JENNIFER R. ABUCEJO'),
(460, 753, '2025-11-20', '10:12:49 AM', 'During inspection, the monitor displayed no signal, and the HDMI cable was identified as faulty.\r\nAction Taken:  Replace HDMI cable only.\r\nRecommendation: Use a properly functioning HDMI cable to prevent signal loss.', 'JEANETTE P. CABAB'),
(461, 749, '2025-11-20', '10:14:10 AM', 'Action Taken: Installed epson L3210 printer\r\nRecommendation: Keep the installer is securely stored for future reference or reinstallation.\r\n', 'JESSTONI B. PERAS'),
(462, 757, '2025-11-20', '04:38:47 PM', 'Upon checking the request, the system unit was found to be continuously beeping.\r\nAction Taken: Reseated the RAM modules and cleaned the RAM slots to ensure proper contact.\r\nRecommendation: Ensure the system unit is placed in a stable, well-ventilated area to maintain proper hardware performance\r\n', 'JEEVA MAE T. RULONA'),
(463, 750, '2025-11-20', '04:43:10 PM', 'Upon verifying the issue, the wire was found to be improperly connected.\r\nAction Taken:  Reconnected the wire securely and ensured all cables were properly attached.\r\nRecommendation:  Place the printer in a stable and fixed position to maintain proper cable alignment.\r\n', 'GEMMA M. PALERMO'),
(464, 756, '2025-11-21', '09:36:21 AM', 'Upon checking, it was determined that the system has low memory specifications, which is the reason for the computer’s slow performance.\r\nAction Taken: Upgraded the RAM from 4GB to 8GB to improve system performance\r\nCleaned the system unit to remove accumulated dust and improve airflow\r\n\r\nRecommendation:  Perform regular preventive maintenance, such as disk cleanup methods.\r\n', 'HERMZ LORENZ PELAYO'),
(465, 735, '2025-11-21', '09:38:46 AM', 'Upon checking, it was determined that the system has low memory specifications, which is the reason for the computer’s slow performance.\r\nAction Taken: Upgraded the RAM from 4GB to 8GB to improve system performance\r\nCleaned the system unit to remove accumulated dust and improve airflow\r\n\r\nRecommendation:  Perform regular preventive maintenance, such as disk cleanup methods.\r\n', 'IVY P. CALOOY'),
(466, 728, '2025-11-21', '09:45:54 AM', 'Upon checking the request, the system was found stuck in F1 mode during startup.\r\n\r\nAction Taken: Removed RAM and clean using eraser and Cleaned the system unit to remove accumulated dust and improve airflow\r\n\r\nRecommendation:  Perform regular preventive maintenance, such as disk cleanup methods.\r\n', 'ZOSIMA S. PASCUAL'),
(467, 734, '2025-11-28', '09:26:08 AM', 'Installed Microsoft 365', 'REDEMTOR A. OJA'),
(468, 761, '2025-11-28', '09:37:50 AM', 'Upon checking the request, it was noted that the Microsoft Office 2016 license has expired\r\nAction: Uninstalled the Microsoft Office 2016 version, and Installed the Microsoft Office 2019 using the provided license key.\r\nRecommendation: \r\nDo not install other versions of Microsoft Office to prevent conflicts.', 'ELSALYN J. EVANGELIO'),
(469, 654, '2025-11-28', '09:46:17 AM', 'Sorry, could not get a suggestion at this time.', 'VAL F. PIEDAD'),
(470, 688, '2025-11-28', '10:13:26 AM', 'Re-installed software installer', 'JULIE ANN BATOHINOG');
INSERT INTO `srfstaff_remarks` (`id`, `track_id`, `date`, `time`, `action_taken`, `actionstaff`) VALUES
(471, 760, '2025-11-28', '10:17:39 AM', 'Upon checking the said request for the printer, Clogged printhead causing backflow.\r\nAction Taken: Performed initial inspection and verified that the printhead was clogged, causing ink backflow and leakage in the cap station area.\r\nRecommendation: It is recommended that the printer sent to the authorized service center \r\nfor proper diagnosis and repair to prevent further damage and restore normal functionality.\r\n', 'ROSEMARIE  P. SALVADOR '),
(472, 716, '2025-11-28', '10:33:49 AM', 'Bitlocker Recovery issue\r\naction taken: Contact datathread supplier to address the concern. \r\nRecommendation: Maintain offline backups of important files in case BitLocker Recovery cannot be bypassed in the future.\r\n', 'REMAR KLIEN H. DAPAR'),
(473, 754, '2025-12-01', '03:49:43 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'GEROME G. SALVADOR'),
(474, 755, '2025-12-01', '03:50:58 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'ROMEO A. ARAOJO, JR.'),
(475, 758, '2025-12-01', '03:51:40 PM', '', 'GEROME G. SALVADOR'),
(476, 759, '2025-12-01', '03:52:33 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'KAREN M. ASTILLO'),
(477, 762, '2025-12-01', '03:53:10 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'MARY GRACE L. KHU'),
(478, 766, '2025-12-05', '04:21:49 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'JOHN CHRISTIAN T. MATILDO'),
(479, 768, '2025-12-15', '01:37:37 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'LEOBETH N. MORDENO'),
(480, 767, '2025-12-15', '01:43:28 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'CLAUDINE B. BARRETE'),
(481, 765, '2025-12-16', '09:29:58 AM', 'Upon checking the said request for the Smat TV no internet connection due to power interruption. \r\nAction Taken: Reconnect the Smart TV password\r\nRecommendation:  Avoid power interruption\r\n', 'REDEMTOR A. OJA	'),
(482, 764, '2025-12-16', '10:25:40 AM', 'Upon checking the printer, Black ink not printing due to clogged printhead and possible airlock.\r\nAction Taken: Perform print head flushing, nozzle check, head cleaning. Still no black color. Possible PrinterHead problem.\r\nRecommendation: Printer Head problem. It is recommended that the printer sent to the authorized service center for proper diagnosis and repair to prevent further damage and restore normal functionality.\r\n', 'EMMANUEL D. ALBANO'),
(483, 763, '2025-12-16', '11:10:48 AM', 'Upon checking spooling error due to multiple printing\r\nAction Taken: Cancelled all printing status and reprint files.\r\nRecommendation: One at a time', 'LORRAINE C. SALIGANAN'),
(484, 778, '2026-01-06', '08:33:41 AM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'YVETH L. CALIAO'),
(485, 779, '2026-01-07', '01:19:48 PM', 'Meeting & Passcode Provided', 'LIZA J. MATURAN'),
(486, 780, '2026-01-07', '02:51:37 PM', 'Upon checking the system unit, the computer didn’t fully start because it detected a system warning during startup. This usually happens due to a minor BIOS setting issue; this has now been fixed.', 'ZOSIMA S. PASCUAL'),
(487, 786, '2026-01-12', '01:28:41 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'HANZEL R. ALERIA'),
(488, 782, '2026-01-12', '01:33:40 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'BEVERLY MAE C. APARRE'),
(489, 796, '2026-01-14', '04:24:23 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'ANCHEDEN J. PACAMALAN'),
(490, 792, '2026-01-14', '04:25:55 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'LORILIE L. PORTES'),
(491, 787, '2026-01-15', '08:24:26 AM', '', 'ELIZABETH A. BOQUE'),
(492, 785, '2026-01-15', '08:26:07 AM', 'Upon checking, the old version of Microsoft Office was found to have an expired license.\r\nAction Taken: Installed Microsoft Office 2019 with a valid license.\r\nRecommendation: Install only the applications that are required.\r\n', 'HAZEL R. TUMANDA'),
(493, 623, '2026-01-15', '08:26:57 AM', 'Upon checking, the old version of Microsoft Office was found to have an expired license.\r\nAction Taken: Installed Microsoft Office 2019 with a valid license.\r\nRecommendation: Install only the applications that are required.\r\n', 'MADELYN R. TAUTJO'),
(494, 783, '2026-01-15', '08:34:38 AM', 'Upon checking, the Wi-Fi dongle was found to support only 2G.\r\nAction Taken: Replaced the Wi-Fi dongle with a 5G-supported device.\r\nRecommendation: Use a 5 GHz or dual-band Wi-Fi dongle to ensure improved network performance and compatibility.\r\n', 'LEAH LOU A. ASIS'),
(495, 794, '2026-01-19', '07:42:02 AM', 'The PC is already set-up', 'JOYLA M. MALAYAN'),
(496, 793, '2026-01-19', '07:43:08 AM', 'PC is already set-up', 'JEEVA MAE T. RULONA'),
(497, 788, '2026-01-19', '09:35:50 AM', 'Upon checking, blue screen appears on the monitor, when turning on\r\nAction Taken: Exit and continue to windows 11 for normal windows start up\r\nRecommendation: Backup important data to external drive.\r\n', 'JOAN A. RUALES'),
(498, 776, '2026-01-19', '09:40:25 AM', 'Upon checking, no color print out\r\nAction Taken: Cleaning procedure printhead\r\nRecommendation: Check ink level regularly and Perform printer cleaning at least once every 2–3 months.\r\n', 'GENALYN A. TAJONERA'),
(499, 799, '2026-01-19', '10:41:31 AM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'PHILIP C. BALTAZAR'),
(500, 791, '2026-01-19', '10:45:11 AM', 'Upon checking, Computer stops responding while using\r\nAction Taken:  Runs Diagnostics Tool until it running normal windows\r\nKeep your operating system, applications, and device drivers up to date to prevent software conflicts that can cause freezing.\r\n', 'JANETH LACAG'),
(501, 800, '2026-01-19', '10:47:49 AM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode', 'JOHN MICHAEL  L. ELERIA'),
(502, 801, '2026-01-19', '03:16:27 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'SHARINE T. CULTURA'),
(503, 803, '2026-01-20', '09:53:29 AM', 'Account status already changed and updated using otos web+ admin account ', 'ANCHEDEN J. PACAMALAN'),
(504, 802, '2026-01-21', '08:21:19 AM', 'Upon Checking, no Microsoft office installed\r\nAction Taken: Installed Microsoft Office 2019 version licensed\r\nRecommendation: Install application requires\r\n', 'JOHN MICHAEL  L. ELERIA'),
(505, 805, '2026-01-22', '02:23:12 PM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'MARY GRACE L. KHU'),
(506, 797, '2026-01-22', '03:49:23 PM', 'Upon inspection, ink overflow was found inside the printer due to an overfilled ink tank. The printer was cleaned; however, a General Error indicator remained.\r\n\r\nFurther checking revealed an unusual sound coming from the right side of the printer near the motor. The ink spillage is assessed to have caused damage to the motor. Considering the extent of the damage and the advanced age of the device, the printer is no longer economical or feasible to repair and is therefore recommended to be declared unserviceable.', 'MARIA ALYZA JOCEL S. DOMINGO'),
(507, 795, '2026-01-22', '03:50:01 PM', 'PC already installed', 'ELIZA C. ASINERO'),
(508, 798, '2026-01-22', '03:50:41 PM', 'PC already installed', 'ELIZA C. ASINERO'),
(509, 804, '2026-01-27', '08:11:38 AM', 'Already Installed the RICO fi Series scanner', 'ANCHEDEN J. PACAMALAN'),
(510, 808, '2026-01-27', '08:15:43 AM', 'The laptop has already been reformatted, and MS Office has been Installed', 'KIM KELLY  D. DATINGGALING'),
(511, 809, '2026-01-27', '11:45:32 AM', 'Upon Checking:\r\nThe printer indicator light continuously blinking, indicating a system error and need to reset.\r\nAction Taken:\r\nPerformed printer reset procedure.\r\nContinue monitoring the printer after the reset and perform nozzle check and head cleaning as needed to ensure proper print quality and functionality.\r\n', 'MARIA THERESA L. GEROLAGA'),
(512, 784, '2026-01-27', '11:56:49 AM', 'Upon Checking:\r\nThe printer was found to have hardened tissue paper and a staple wire stuck inside the paper feed mechanism, causing blockage and triggering the blinking indicator light.\r\nAction Taken: Carefully removed the hardened tissue from the printer and other hard object . However, due to the blockage, the panel flex cable and printer head were damaged. Status DEFFECTIVE.\r\n\r\nRecommendation:\r\nSend the printer to an authorized service center for further repair/diagnosis and proper replacement of the damaged parts.\r\n', 'BEA ELAINE A. HAYA'),
(513, 811, '2026-02-02', '07:19:15 AM', 'Upon checking the printer, it was found that its waste inkpad needed to be reset. The EPSON L360 resetter was run successfully, and the printer has now been reset and is currently being used again by the end-user.', 'KAY S. DALOGDOG'),
(514, 810, '2026-02-02', '07:41:54 AM', 'Upon inspection, the printer was found to have no black ink and had previously been repaired for the same issue. Several troubleshooting measures were conducted, including ink flushing and ink pad cleaning; however, no black ink was produced. Eventually, the printer displayed a general error, with unusual motor sounds and no ink pad movement. Ink overflow in the ink tank was also observed. Considering the unit’s age, repeated repairs, and worn-out ink pad, the printer is no longer repairable and is recommended to be declared unserviceable.', 'MARIA ALYZA JOCEL S. DOMINGO'),
(515, 817, '2026-02-04', '09:03:39 AM', 'The New set of computer has already set up', 'JEEVA MAE T. RULONA'),
(516, 807, '2026-02-04', '10:20:56 AM', 'Upon checking the laptop’s charger, it was found that a power issue had caused a temporary power loss on the motherboard. The problem has already been fixed, and the laptop is now working properly and currently in use.', 'JAYSON D. PALOQUIA'),
(517, 812, '2026-02-04', '10:28:02 AM', 'Upon checking the printer, the indicator light showed that service was required. The printer firmware was reset as part of the troubleshooting process, and the device is now functioning properly and can be used again by the user.', 'CHERRY MAE G. PECJO'),
(518, 813, '2026-02-04', '10:31:00 AM', 'The new printer was installed and properly configured with the necessary driver for operation.', 'SUGAR E. PERAS'),
(519, 815, '2026-02-04', '02:08:16 PM', 'Upon checking the computer, the HDD was replaced with an SSD to improve performance. However, after the replacement, Windows 11 could not be installed because the system does not meet the minimum requirements, specifically the processor requirement of at least an Intel Core i5 (8th Generation).\r\n\r\nInstalling Windows 10 is also not recommended since it is no longer supported by Microsoft in terms of security updates.\r\n\r\nConsidering that the desktop was purchased in 2017 and is already outdated, it can no longer keep up with modern system requirements. In view of these limitations, it is therefore recommended that the unit be declared unserviceable.', 'JESSIE  M. CORALER'),
(520, 830, '2026-02-10', '10:25:54 AM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'JOYLA M. MALAYAN'),
(521, 829, '2026-02-10', '10:47:39 AM', 'Google Meet Link provided', 'HANZEL R. ALERIA'),
(522, 827, '2026-02-10', '10:50:36 AM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode Provided', 'SUGAR E. PERAS'),
(523, 825, '2026-02-10', '10:51:32 AM', 'Meeting ID & Passcode provided', 'ELSALYN J. EVANGELIO'),
(524, 824, '2026-02-10', '10:52:12 AM', 'Meeting & Passcode provided', 'JOHN MICHAEL  L. ELERIA'),
(525, 819, '2026-02-10', '10:54:14 AM', 'ENGAS already configure and can be use by the requestee', 'MARY CLAIRE C. HINGPIT'),
(526, 814, '2026-02-10', '10:58:46 AM', 'The laptop was running slowly because it was still using an HDD. To improve its performance, the HDD was replaced with an SSD, resulting in faster and smoother operation.', 'JENNY MAE M. CULLANTES');
