(916, 722, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Corrupted Memory card\r\nAction Taken:  Fix corrupted SD card using CMD methods.\r\nRecommendation:  It is recommended to purchase SD cards only from trusted or authorized stores to ensure reliability and prevent data corruption. It is also advised to back up your files regularly for safety and future use.', '2025-11-20', '09:39:16 AM'),
(917, 746, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Upon checking the printer, a foreign object was found stuck inside, which caused the paper jam.Action Taken:  The Object carefully removed inside the printer and Perform the regular maintenance checks to prevent jams.Recommendation:  Cover the printer after use to protect it from dust and foreign objects and perform regular maintenance and inspection to ensure smooth printer operation.', '2025-11-12', '12:31 PM'),
(918, 753, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'During inspection, the monitor displayed no signal, and the HDMI cable was identified as faulty.Action Taken:  Replace HDMI cable only.Recommendation: Use a properly functioning HDMI cable to prevent signal loss.', '2025-11-17', '01:28 PM'),
