(925, 757, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Upon checking the request, the system unit was found to be continuously beeping.Action Taken: Reseated the RAM modules and cleaned the RAM slots to ensure proper contact.Recommendation: Ensure the system unit is placed in a stable, well-ventilated area to maintain proper hardware performance', '2025-11-19', '04:11 PM'),
(926, 750, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Upon verifying the issue, the wire was found to be improperly connected.Action Taken:  Reconnected the wire securely and ensured all cables were properly attached.Recommendation:  Place the printer in a stable and fixed position to maintain proper cable alignment.', '2025-11-14', '12:49 PM'),
(927, 756, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Upon checking, it was determined that the system has low memory specifications, which is the reason for the computer’s slow performance.Action Taken: Upgraded the RAM from 4GB to 8GB to improve system performanceCleaned the system unit to remove accumulated dust and improve airflowRecommendation:  Perform regular preventive maintenance, such as disk cleanup methods.', '2025-11-18', '11:45 AM'),
(928, 735, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Upon checking, it was determined that the system has low memory specifications, which is the reason for the computer’s slow performance.Action Taken: Upgraded the RAM from 4GB to 8GB to improve system performanceCleaned the system unit to remove accumulated dust and improve airflowRecommendation:  Perform regular preventive maintenance, such as disk cleanup methods.', '2025-11-07', '01:16 PM'),
