(955, 765, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Upon checking the said request for the Smat TV no internet connection due to power interruption. Action Taken: Reconnect the Smart TV passwordRecommendation:  Avoid power interruption', '2025-12-06', '09:29 AM'),
(956, 764, '1915', 'Emmanuel D. Gonzales', 'Upon checking the printer, Black ink not printing due to clogged printhead and possible airlock.Action Taken: Perform print head flushing, nozzle check, head cleaning. Still no black color. Possible PrinterHead problem.Recommendation: Printer Head problem. It is recommended that the printer sent to the authorized service center for proper diagnosis and repair to prevent further damage and restore normal functionality.', '2025-12-02', '12:20 PM'),
