(1036, 807, '59', 'CLEOVIN C. SILONG', 'Upon checking the laptop’s charger, it was found that a power issue had caused a temporary power loss on the motherboard. The problem has already been fixed, and the laptop is now working properly and currently in use.', '2026-02-04', '10:20:56 AM'),
(1037, 812, '59', 'CLEOVIN C. SILONG', 'Upon checking the printer, the indicator light showed that service was required. The printer firmware was reset as part of the troubleshooting process, and the device is now functioning properly and can be used again by the user.', '2026-01-27', '11:55 AM'),
(1038, 813, '59', 'CLEOVIN C. SILONG', 'The new printer was installed and properly configured with the necessary driver for operation.', '2026-01-28', '12:09 PM'),
(1039, 821, '58', 'MARIETTA L. CHUA', 'Vin for your appropriate action', '2026-02-04', '11:36:00 AM'),
(1040, 815, '59', 'CLEOVIN C. SILONG', 'Upon checking the computer, the HDD was replaced with an SSD to improve performance. However, after the replacement, Windows 11 could not be installed because the system does not meet the minimum requirements, specifically the processor requirement of at least an Intel Core i5 (8th Generation).Installing Windows 10 is also not recommended since it is no longer supported by Microsoft in terms of security updates.Considering that the desktop was purchased in 2017 and is already outdated, it can no longer keep up with modern system requirements. In view of these limitations, it is therefore recommended that the unit be declared unserviceable.', '2026-01-28', '09:50 PM'),
